        "reason": "Independently read both cited ranges. __CARDRead tests attachment, initializes request state and launches 512-byte segment reads; BlockReadCallback continues or terminates on failure. CARDMount invokes this helper for system blocks before final verification and API completion. The purpose correction agrees with functionality.md; existing names and unchanged knowledge are retained through the handoff."
